    "title": "Google investing in Buffalo area where data center is planned - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jack Carlson ,\n4 hours ago BUFFALO, W.Va. — Google and 84 Lumber are teaming up to support several local organizations in Putnam County. Google announced its intentions to establish a data center in Buffalo in March. Last month, the Putnam County Commission reported that Google wants to hold a town hall-style discussion with the community. No date has been set for that meeting yet. Read full article",
